1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Hi, we’re Team Salooms.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Our challenge: tell the story of
the hardware NASA left on the Moon.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
So we built Leave It Behind, a Moon mission game
where you can’t take it all home.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,800
Collect samples and set up experiments
that still work on the Moon today,

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,000
then throw out gear to lift off.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Every mission and fact comes from NASA’s Apollo records
and its catalogue of objects left on the Moon.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Students learn real engineering trade-offs by playing,
on any phone or school laptop.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,800
Sometimes you have to lose something to make something.
Play free at saloom-inc.github.io/nasa
